The reference solution loops i from 0 while i*a <= n, checks whether (n - i*a) % b == 0, and returns (i, (n - i*a)//b). For (2, 3, 7): i=0 gives 7%3≠0, i=1 gives 5%3≠0, i=2 gives 3%3=0, so it returns (2, 1), which matches the assert.

